  "thought": "The current analysis base is selected. Now I need to examine the operator group loads and monetary cost breakdown to understand the mixed bottleneck. The FFN group dominates latency, attention dominates energy, and memory/communication layers limit the critical path. I'll call aggregate_layer_loads to see operator group contributions and then summarize_monetary_cost to understand cost structure before proposing a hardware update.",
  "action": "tool",
  "tool": {
    "name": "aggregate_layer_loads",
    "arguments": {
      "view": "groups",
      "sort_by": "latency_sum",
      "top_groups": 6,
      "include_components": true
    }
  }
}

